WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.473
On the ride to Lady Katherine’s home, Mandy introduced herself.

2
00:00:06.474 --> 00:00:08.187
Then she asked:

3
00:00:08.188 --> 00:00:10.006
"Where am I?"

4
00:00:10.007 --> 00:00:15.502
Lady Katherine thought Mandy was confused after her accident.

5
00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:19.611
"Why, child, you’re in London, England.

6
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:21.912
Elizabeth is our queen,"

7
00:00:21.913 --> 00:00:25.681
said Lady Katherine in a comforting way.

8
00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:30.133
Mandy had read about Elizabeth I of England.

9
00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:34.288
She thought it would be great to actually meet her.

10
00:00:34.289 --> 00:00:39.137
"Is the queen as kind as people say?" asked Mandy.

11
00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:44.271
"Her majesty is good and fair," replied Lady Katherine.

12
00:00:44.272 --> 00:00:47.690
"England has never been so peaceful."

13
00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:49.935
Mandy looked outside.

14
00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:53.024
She noticed how busy the streets were.

15
00:00:53.025 --> 00:00:57.606
Women wore long dresses and some carried baskets.

16
00:00:57.607 --> 00:01:01.900
Men wore fancy hats decorated with feathers.

17
00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:07.140
Horses and carriages filled the streets.

18
00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:10.006
They arrived at Lady Katherine’s home.

19
00:01:10.007 --> 00:01:12.692
A servant opened the door.

20
00:01:12.693 --> 00:01:16.736
"The girl has been hurt," Lady Katherine said.

21
00:01:16.737 --> 00:01:19.946
"Please take care of her."

22
00:01:19.947 --> 00:01:24.887
When her knee was cleaned up, Mandy was led into a big room.

23
00:01:24.888 --> 00:01:30.880
Two other servants brought trays of cakes, gingerbread, and almond milk.

24
00:01:30.881 --> 00:01:33.989
"Thank you," she said to them.

25
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.478
The servants smiled at her.

26
00:01:36.479 --> 00:01:42.216
"Have you been with Lady Katherine a long time?" asked Mandy.

27
00:01:42.217 --> 00:01:48.601
"Our family has always served Lady Katherine’s family," said one servant.

28
00:01:48.602 --> 00:01:53.873
"Oh! Do you like to work for Lady Katherine?" asked Mandy.

29
00:01:53.874 --> 00:01:57.195
"Lady Katherine is very good to us.

30
00:01:57.196 --> 00:02:02.208
We are treated like part of the family," replied the other servant.

31
00:02:02.209 --> 00:02:07.608
Meanwhile, Vinnie and Edward were having lunch with Master Crossland.

32
00:02:07.609 --> 00:02:11.462
The tailor and his family lived above the shop.

33
00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:14.828
They all shared one small room.

34
00:02:14.829 --> 00:02:22.933
"If you’re looking for work," said the tailor, nodding to Vinnie, "I could use your help today."

35
00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:27.400
Vinnie looked at Edward, and the boy nodded, smiling.

36
00:02:27.401 --> 00:02:30.162
"Sure," Vinnie replied.

37
00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:33.746
He ate some more bread.

38
00:02:33.747 --> 00:02:39.469
After the meal, Master Crossland took the boys back down to the shop.

39
00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.099
He showed Vinnie how to cut some cotton cloth.

40
00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.345
Vinnie had to be very careful.

41
00:02:46.346 --> 00:02:50.942
"Oops! I cut too much!" Vinnie cried.

42
00:02:50.943 --> 00:02:55.667
"You’ll get better with practice," said the tailor.

43
00:02:55.668 --> 00:02:58.749
Vinnie had trouble cutting the cloth.

44
00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.895
But Edward was very good at it.

45
00:03:01.896 --> 00:03:08.000
"You will make a fine tailor one day," Master Crossland said to Edward.

46
00:03:08.001 --> 00:03:13.348
"Maybe I can make the costumes for the Globe Theater," said Edward.

47
00:03:13.349 --> 00:03:16.737
"Then I could meet Shakespeare and . . ."

48
00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:22.028
"Get those crazy ideas out of your head," said the tailor.

49
00:03:22.029 --> 00:03:26.083
"Working at the Globe will not feed your family."

50
00:03:26.084 --> 00:03:30.557
Suddenly, a well-dressed man came into the shop.

51
00:03:30.558 --> 00:03:34.306
He wore a cloak with a high collar.

52
00:03:34.307 --> 00:03:38.147
"Welcome, Lord Crumley!" said the tailor.

53
00:03:38.148 --> 00:03:41.237
"Lads, bring me those three rolls of silk!"

54
00:03:41.238 --> 00:03:43.831
He pointed to a corner.

55
00:03:43.832 --> 00:03:47.409
Edward and Vinnie went to get the silk.

56
00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.108
"Quick," said the lord. "I’m in a hurry!"

57
00:03:51.109 --> 00:03:54.010
He frowned as he took off his cloak.

58
00:03:54.011 --> 00:03:57.491
Lord Crumley was a very rich man.

59
00:03:57.492 --> 00:04:05.969
But he did not seem very kind.

